{"id":"86c6b889a83607ba","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-normal-derivative.md","title":"正规函数的导函数","display":"df-normal-derivative — 正规函数的导函数","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-normal-derivative","aliases":["18-df-normal-derivative"],"display":"df-normal-derivative — 正规函数的导函数","depends_on":["[[18-df-normal-function]]","[[18-df-fixed-point-set]]","[[18-df-well-order-enumeration]]","[[18-thm-normal-fixed-points]]","[[18-df-successor-limit-ordinal]]"],"source_title":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity","source_edition":"Springer, 2009; ISBN 978-3-540-69318-5","source_section":"Definition 3.4.1; Lemma 3.4.2; Theorem 3.2.19","source_printed_pages":"27–28, 35","source_pdf_pages":"37–38, 45","source_correspondence":"derivative-definition-and-full-class-normality","source_statement_status":"checked-2026-10-13","verification_status":"source-statement-and-proof-checked-with-local-full-class-argument"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-normal-derivative"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-normal-derivative</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-normal-derivative — 正规函数的导函数"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"83adc13498d19c2f\" href=\"?note=83adc13498d19c2f\" title=\"18-df-normal-function\">18-df-normal-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"779baa2ce0d8c0d8\" href=\"?note=779baa2ce0d8c0d8\" title=\"18-df-fixed-point-set\">18-df-fixed-point-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0add8a5835559b4b\" href=\"?note=0add8a5835559b4b\" title=\"18-df-well-order-enumeration\">18-df-well-order-enumeration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"92f365ec0f2e26f3\" href=\"?note=92f365ec0f2e26f3\" title=\"18-thm-normal-fixed-points\">18-thm-normal-fixed-points</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"dbde69396a089d39\" href=\"?note=dbde69396a089d39\" title=\"18-df-successor-limit-ordinal\">18-df-successor-limit-ordinal</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_title","html":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Springer, 2009; ISBN 978-3-540-69318-5"},{"key":"source_section","html":"Definition 3.4.1; Lemma 3.4.2; Theorem 3.2.19"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"27–28, 35"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"37–38, 45"},{"key":"source_correspondence","html":"derivative-definition-and-full-class-normality"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-2026-10-13"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-proof-checked-with-local-full-class-argument"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\mathrm{Ord}\\to\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(f:\\mathrm{Ord}\\to\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> 是可定义全类函数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Normal}(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{Normal}(f)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Normal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Normal}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"83adc13498d19c2f\" href=\"?note=83adc13498d19c2f\" title=\"18-df-normal-function\">18-df-normal-function</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fix},\\mathrm{Enum},\\mathrm{IncEnum}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fix},\\mathrm{Enum},\\mathrm{IncEnum}\\)</span> 分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"779baa2ce0d8c0d8\" href=\"?note=779baa2ce0d8c0d8\" title=\"18-df-fixed-point-set\">18-df-fixed-point-set</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"0add8a5835559b4b\" href=\"?note=0add8a5835559b4b\" title=\"18-df-well-order-enumeration\">18-df-well-order-enumeration</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f&#39;\">\\(f&#39;\\)</span> 为下式引入的导函数，其图为可定义类，不作为集合函数量化。不动点类的无界性及非空集合上确界闭性见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"92f365ec0f2e26f3\" href=\"?note=92f365ec0f2e26f3\" title=\"18-thm-normal-fixed-points\">18-thm-normal-fixed-points</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{succ}\">\\(\\operatorname{succ}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"dbde69396a089d39\" href=\"?note=dbde69396a089d39\" title=\"18-df-successor-limit-ordinal\">18-df-successor-limit-ordinal</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f&#39;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Enum}(\\mathrm{Fix}(f)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f&#39;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Enum}(\\mathrm{Fix}(f)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}(f&#39;)=\\mathrm{Ord}\\land\n\\operatorname{ran}(f&#39;)=\\mathrm{Fix}(f)\\land\n\\mathrm{IncEnum}(\\mathrm{Fix}(f),f&#39;)\\land\\mathrm{Normal}(f&#39;).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{dom}(f&#39;)=\\mathrm{Ord}\\land\n\\operatorname{ran}(f&#39;)=\\mathrm{Fix}(f)\\land\n\\mathrm{IncEnum}(\\mathrm{Fix}(f),f&#39;)\\land\\mathrm{Normal}(f&#39;).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f&#39;(0)=\\min\\mathrm{Fix}(f),\\qquad\nf&#39;(\\operatorname{succ}(\\alpha))=\n\\min\\{\\eta\\in\\mathrm{Fix}(f):f&#39;(\\alpha)&lt;\\eta\\}\n\\qquad(\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f&#39;(0)=\\min\\mathrm{Fix}(f),\\qquad\nf&#39;(\\operatorname{succ}(\\alpha))=\n\\min\\{\\eta\\in\\mathrm{Fix}(f):f&#39;(\\alpha)&lt;\\eta\\}\n\\qquad(\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应 Definition 3.4.1 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f&#39;=\\mathrm{en}_{\\mathrm{Fix}(f)}\">\\(f&#39;=\\mathrm{en}_{\\mathrm{Fix}(f)}\\)</span>。已读 Lemma 3.4.2 与 Theorem 3.2.19 的陈述和证明；所列全类接口另由本地论证核对：不动点无界，故它为真类，Enum 的指标域为 Ord。枚举严格递增；若 λ 是非零极限，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s=\\sup_{\\xi&lt;\\lambda}f&#39;(\\xi)\">\\(s=\\sup_{\\xi&lt;\\lambda}f&#39;(\\xi)\\)</span> 仍为不动点。s 不能等于任何较早项，且小于 s 的不动点已出现在 λ 前，因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f&#39;(\\lambda)=s\">\\(f&#39;(\\lambda)=s\\)</span>。零与后继方程来自递增枚举的定义，所取最小值由非空性和序数良序保证。</p>\n<p>新增前已查本目录全部原子及 glossary；fixed-point-set 仅有 Fix，023 在 Veblen 递归中使用不动点枚举而未单列一般导函数。此处使用现有全域 Normal，不引入或更改 κ-normal 部分函数接口。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-normal-function","status":"resolved","id":"83adc13498d19c2f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-normal-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-fixed-point-set","status":"resolved","id":"779baa2ce0d8c0d8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-fixed-point-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-well-order-enumeration","status":"resolved","id":"0add8a5835559b4b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-well-order-enumeration]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-thm-normal-fixed-points","status":"resolved","id":"92f365ec0f2e26f3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-thm-normal-fixed-points]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-successor-limit-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"dbde69396a089d39","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-successor-limit-ordinal]]",